  "name": "Biological, Chemical and Physical Characteristics of Saanich Inlet, 1982-1984",
  "description": "Study of biological, chemical, and physical characteristics of Saanich Inlet, B.C.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Carbon cycling in Saanich Inlet, sedimentation rates, rates of bacterial and biological production.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data not secured in regional data centre. Risk of Loss: Medium Impact Justification: Does not affect a wide variety of users. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: Bring data to archives Additional Info: Good quality data. See Ken Lee for information on bacteriological data.",
